Best Practices for Staying Within the Apex Heap Limit
Do not use class-level variables to store large amounts of data-- dont use variable in top , use the variable in methods so that if method is complete it can free up heap size
Use SOQL For Loops to iterate and process data from large queries rather than loading all results into a single collection. -- since in for loop record comes in batch of 
